On 12/4/05 5:40 PM, MrGoose wrote:
> When you download version 3.4.3 their are tile sets, I downloaded
> them but don't know how to add that line of text.

You add the line of text to your options file, not the tile set file. 
The options file is a text file in your Nethack playground. If you're 
using Windows, it will be called "defaults.nh," if you're using Linux, 
it will probably be called ".nethackrc" (I think).

Just open it with Notepad or another text editor, add the line, and resave.

